Third-party Rust crates in Music Zamlr's desktop shell
=====================================================

Generated by cargo-about from the shell's Cargo.lock each time a release
is built, so it lists the crates of the shell that release contains. To
preview it locally, from frontend/src-tauri:

    cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD-PARTY-RUST.txt

